## Your two skills

Both are already installed on the shelf you chose. In a **new
conversation**, try:

- **Voice** — "Write an Instagram post about {{SAMPLE_TOPIC}} in our voice."
  If it sounds unmistakably {{BRAND}}, it's working.
- **Design** — "Make me a one-pager about {{SAMPLE_TOPIC}}, on-brand."
  If it comes back in your colors and fonts, it's working.

## Judging the results

- Open `{{BRAND}}_Design_System.pdf` — it is rendered **in** the colors
  and fonts it documents, so a wrong value is visible at a glance.
- The voice guide includes calibration pairs (generic AI copy vs. your
  voice) so anyone on your team can judge fit instantly.

## Updating later

Just ask: "update our brand skills — change X." The builder finds this
folder, applies the edit everywhere it matters, and re-renders only
what changed.
